				{
					"id": 30080616,
					"content": "「既視感」？沒有，不過前面這些年，我一直困在每天都差不多的人生裡，就算有既視感也已經習慣了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080617,
					"content": "這樣嗎…難道只有我和旅行者才有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080618,
					"content": "時間差不多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080619,
					"content": "嗯？什麼時間？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080620,
					"content": "妮露的花神之舞就要開場了，我們走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080613,
					"content": "妳有沒有察覺到一些異樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080614
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 300807,
			"completionStepIds": [
				300807
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"300807",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 300807,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"妮露"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 30080701,
					"content": "…以妳的學識，我不認為妳具備與我辯論的資格。妳現在該做的，是盡快找人把這些可笑的佈置撤掉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿扎爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080702,
					"content": "回去之後，讓書記官在下次「識藏日」前擬定好禁止公開藝術表演的法令，屆時再透過虛空公佈給民眾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿扎爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080703,
					"content": "是，我回去就通知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞塔蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080704,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿扎爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080705,
					"content": "花神誕祭…你們就好好慶祝神明的誕生吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿扎爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080706,
					"content": "妮露，妳還好吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080707,
					"content": "啊，迪娜澤黛，大賢者居然要求我們停止演出…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080708,
					"content": "沒關係的，這也是沒辦法的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080709,
					"content": "明明妳一直那麼期待的，我不想讓妳留下遺憾…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080710,
					"content": "的確很遺憾，但對我來說，不給大家添麻煩更加重要。大賢者已經說過可能會查辦發起人了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080711,
					"content": "話雖這麼說…那好吧，下次花神誕祭我們一定想辦法讓它圓滿！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080712,
					"content": "下次嗎？我應該…已經不在了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080713,
					"content": "嗯？妳剛剛說什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080714,
					"content": "沒什麼，我要回去休息了，大家辛苦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080715,
					"content": "那些不解風情的賢者們，居然會這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080716,
						30080717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080716,
					"content": "太可惜了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30080718,
					"content": "欸，迪娜澤黛已經回去了嗎？那我們也回去休息吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080719,
					"content": "花神誕祭在遺憾的氛圍中被迫中止了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 30080717,
					"content": "不知為何感覺也是意料之中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080718
					]
				}
			]
		},
