				{
					"id": 30080801,
					"content": "所以到頭來，既視感的事還是沒什麼頭緒嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080802,
					"content": "會不會真的只是太累了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080803,
						30080804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080803,
					"content": "好像腦袋確實昏沉沉的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30080805,
					"content": "我也有這種感覺！所以我其實中午開始就放棄思考了，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080806,
					"content": "既然如此，我們還是早點休息吧，就當是太累產生的幻覺…有什麼事明天再想吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080807,
					"content": "「滴——」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080808,
					"content": "…知能輸出略有下降，但仍在正常臨界值範圍內。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡瓦賈"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080809,
					"content": "繼續留意數值變動，盡早查明原因。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿扎爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 30080804,
					"content": "沒有思考太多，但頭腦卻特別疲憊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30080805
					]
				}
			]
		},
